    "name": "Dragonheir: Silent Gods",
    "steam_appid": 2203070,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The classic dark fantasy strategy RPG Dragonheir: Silent Gods returns with its Reborn update! Experience the official Dungeons &amp; Dragons collaboration event, back for a limited time, featuring the legendary hero Drizzt Do'Urden with his signature weapons. The Reborn update brings massive improvements after months offline: log in now to claim 650 FREE summons, enjoy 70% discount on pulls, and participate in the &quot;Summon More, Get More&quot; event to build your ultimate team. Discover completely revamped strategic gameplay and unprecedented exploration freedom in this thoroughly reworked adventure\u2014join the rebirth now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c9New Version Highlights\u25c9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3013Fight Alongside Legends, Attain New Glory\u3013</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On August 1st, the legendary Western fantasy IP &quot;Dungeons &amp; Dragons&quot; official collaboration continues! The legendary hero Drizzt makes a powerful return\u2014you'll fight alongside him and unlock unique battle abilities with his exclusive Artifact. Uncover buried secrets in classic collaboration story quests. Don't miss this excitement\u2014stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/5b7753681a55f465a07ee5dc8e746d8b.poster.avif?t=1752627973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/5b7753681a55f465a07ee5dc8e746d8b.webm?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/5b7753681a55f465a07ee5dc8e746d8b.mp4?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3013Boundless Freedom in Exploration\u3013</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sandbox open world features diverse landscapes, from shadowy forests to scorching deserts, mysterious underground realms to vast archipelagos\u2014each hiding surprises waiting to be discovered. Create your protagonist freely, with your attribute choices influencing story directions. Roll dice to trigger random events and interact with NPCs to unlock hidden quests, experiencing an adventure journey filled with unknowns and extraordinary encounters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/9e79fbfca7a7b7b78863906d0ef2e212.poster.avif?t=1752627973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/9e79fbfca7a7b7b78863906d0ef2e212.webm?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/9e79fbfca7a7b7b78863906d0ef2e212.mp4?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3013Epic Benefit Discounts\u3013</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the &quot;Prophecy Summons&quot; and &quot;Account Appraisal&quot; events now to get massive amounts of free summons and abundant resource packs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The summoning system gets a complete overhaul in the Reborn version\u2014single summons now only cost 100 Wyrmarrow, with 70% off summon privileges available immediately upon launch! You can also get additional Summon Dice and selectable Legendary heroes through the concurrent &quot;Summon More, Get More&quot; celebration event\u2014building your desired lineup has never been easier. Command an army of champions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/63e5001a96c45a60de3a2c87922189e0.poster.avif?t=1752627973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/63e5001a96c45a60de3a2c87922189e0.webm?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/63e5001a96c45a60de3a2c87922189e0.mp4?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3013Strategies Renewed and Upgraded\u3013</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The brand-new Hero Talent system revolutionizes traditional progression! 300+ heroes each boasts 12 unique Talent effects, with no talent trees limiting your mixes and matches! Unlock exclusive battle abilities for your heroes and customize in-depth tactical styles! Make every battle your strategic masterpiece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/b91985850c27957afd07a86956decefc.poster.avif?t=1752627973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/b91985850c27957afd07a86956decefc.webm?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/b91985850c27957afd07a86956decefc.mp4?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3013A Burden-Free Experience\u3013</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embracing the philosophy of returning to strategic gameplay, we've created the innovative &quot;Resonance Level&quot; system. Level up once, shared across your entire team! Gone are the days of individually leveling each character\u2014now your entire roster benefits from shared progression, letting you focus on what truly matters: tactics and discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/7c007c5d560618c8d73ec2f67a21912e.poster.avif?t=1752627973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/7c007c5d560618c8d73ec2f67a21912e.webm?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/7c007c5d560618c8d73ec2f67a21912e.mp4?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The classic dark fantasy strategy RPG Dragonheir: Silent Gods returns with its Reborn update! Experience the official Dungeons &amp; Dragons collaboration event, back for a limited time, featuring the legendary hero Drizzt Do'Urden with his signature weapons. The Reborn update brings massive improvements after months offline: log in now to claim 650 FREE summons, enjoy 70% discount on pulls, and participate in the &quot;Summon More, Get More&quot; event to build your ultimate team. Discover completely revamped strategic gameplay and unprecedented exploration freedom in this thoroughly reworked adventure\u2014join the rebirth now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c9New Version Highlights\u25c9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3013Fight Alongside Legends, Attain New Glory\u3013</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On August 1st, the legendary Western fantasy IP &quot;Dungeons &amp; Dragons&quot; official collaboration continues! The legendary hero Drizzt makes a powerful return\u2014you'll fight alongside him and unlock unique battle abilities with his exclusive Artifact. Uncover buried secrets in classic collaboration story quests. Don't miss this excitement\u2014stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/5b7753681a55f465a07ee5dc8e746d8b.poster.avif?t=1752627973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/5b7753681a55f465a07ee5dc8e746d8b.webm?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/5b7753681a55f465a07ee5dc8e746d8b.mp4?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3013Boundless Freedom in Exploration\u3013</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sandbox open world features diverse landscapes, from shadowy forests to scorching deserts, mysterious underground realms to vast archipelagos\u2014each hiding surprises waiting to be discovered. Create your protagonist freely, with your attribute choices influencing story directions. Roll dice to trigger random events and interact with NPCs to unlock hidden quests, experiencing an adventure journey filled with unknowns and extraordinary encounters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/9e79fbfca7a7b7b78863906d0ef2e212.poster.avif?t=1752627973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/9e79fbfca7a7b7b78863906d0ef2e212.webm?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/9e79fbfca7a7b7b78863906d0ef2e212.mp4?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3013Epic Benefit Discounts\u3013</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the &quot;Prophecy Summons&quot; and &quot;Account Appraisal&quot; events now to get massive amounts of free summons and abundant resource packs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The summoning system gets a complete overhaul in the Reborn version\u2014single summons now only cost 100 Wyrmarrow, with 70% off summon privileges available immediately upon launch! You can also get additional Summon Dice and selectable Legendary heroes through the concurrent &quot;Summon More, Get More&quot; celebration event\u2014building your desired lineup has never been easier. Command an army of champions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/63e5001a96c45a60de3a2c87922189e0.poster.avif?t=1752627973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/63e5001a96c45a60de3a2c87922189e0.webm?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/63e5001a96c45a60de3a2c87922189e0.mp4?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3013Strategies Renewed and Upgraded\u3013</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The brand-new Hero Talent system revolutionizes traditional progression! 300+ heroes each boasts 12 unique Talent effects, with no talent trees limiting your mixes and matches! Unlock exclusive battle abilities for your heroes and customize in-depth tactical styles! Make every battle your strategic masterpiece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/b91985850c27957afd07a86956decefc.poster.avif?t=1752627973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/b91985850c27957afd07a86956decefc.webm?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/b91985850c27957afd07a86956decefc.mp4?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3013A Burden-Free Experience\u3013</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embracing the philosophy of returning to strategic gameplay, we've created the innovative &quot;Resonance Level&quot; system. Level up once, shared across your entire team! Gone are the days of individually leveling each character\u2014now your entire roster benefits from shared progression, letting you focus on what truly matters: tactics and discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/7c007c5d560618c8d73ec2f67a21912e.poster.avif?t=1752627973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/7c007c5d560618c8d73ec2f67a21912e.webm?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203070/extras/7c007c5d560618c8d73ec2f67a21912e.mp4?t=1752627973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
